Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.79,0:00:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我身为神社继承人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.55,0:00:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,预计和巫女三姐妹的…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.75,0:00:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,其中一人结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.58,0:00:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不认识 你谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.21,0:00:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好恶心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,简直就是宅宅妄想的人设
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你们等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么没有人记得我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:38.25,screen1,,0,0,0,,{\fn@\frz300\fs55\pos(780,900)\fad(2000,0)}书呆子
